{"seq":6,"slug":"signal-integrity","title":"信号完整性","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.08,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信号完整性-signal-integrity\">信号完整性（Signal Integrity）</h1><p>信号完整性是高速电子系统设计中的核心学科，研究电信号在互连结构中传输时的质量保持问题。随着数字系统数据速率突破数十 Gbps，信号上升时间缩短至皮秒级别，PCB 走线不再是简单的导线，而是必须按照传输线理论进行精确设计的电磁结构。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 系统性地覆盖信号完整性的四大支柱：传输线理论基础、串扰与电磁干扰、高速接口设计实践，以及测量与仿真技术。从基础物理模型出发，逐步深入到 DDR5、SerDes 等前沿应用场景，帮助读者建立完整的信号完整性分析能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识体系结构\">知识体系结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[信号完整性] --&gt; B[传输线理论]&#10;    A --&gt; C[串扰与EMI]&#10;    A --&gt; D[高速接口设计]&#10;    A --&gt; E[测量与仿真]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[传输线模型与特征阻抗]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[反射与阻抗匹配]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[有损传输线分析]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[串扰机理与耦合]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[EMI源与传播路径]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[屏蔽与滤波设计]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[DDR信号完整性]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[SerDes高速串行链路]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[眼图分析与均衡]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[TDR/VNA测量]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[S参数网络分析]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[SI仿真工具]\">graph TD\n    A[信号完整性] --&gt; B[传输线理论]\n    A --&gt; C[串扰与EMI]\n    A --&gt; D[高速接口设计]\n    A --&gt; E[测量与仿真]\n    B --&gt; B1[传输线模型与特征阻抗]\n    B --&gt; B2[反射与阻抗匹配]\n    B --&gt; B3[有损传输线分析]\n    C --&gt; C1[串扰机理与耦合]\n    C --&gt; C2[EMI源与传播路径]\n    C --&gt; C3[屏蔽与滤波设计]\n    D --&gt; D1[DDR信号完整性]\n    D --&gt; D2[SerDes高速串行链路]\n    D --&gt; D3[眼图分析与均衡]\n    E --&gt; E1[TDR/VNA测量]\n    E --&gt; E2[S参数网络分析]\n    E --&gt; E3[SI仿真工具]</pre><h2 id=\"适用读者\">适用读者</h2><p>具备基础电路理论知识，希望深入理解高速 PCB 设计中信号质量问题的硬件工程师、系统架构师和电子工程专业学习者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>电磁场与电磁波基础</li>\n<li>模拟电路与数字电路原理</li>\n<li>基本 PCB 设计概念</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transmission-line-theory","title":"传输线理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transmission-line-model","title":"传输线模型与特征阻抗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/transmission-line-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reflection-matching","title":"反射与阻抗匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/reflection-matching"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lossy-line-analysis","title":"有损传输线分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/transmission-line-theory/lossy-line-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"crosstalk-emi","title":"串扰与电磁干扰","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crosstalk-mechanisms","title":"串扰机理与耦合模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/crosstalk-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emi-sources-paths","title":"EMI 源与传播路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/emi-sources-paths"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shielding-filtering-design","title":"屏蔽与滤波设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/shielding-filtering-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-speed-design","title":"高速接口设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddr-signal-integrity","title":"DDR 信号完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/ddr-signal-integrity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serdes-high-speed-serial","title":"SerDes 与高速串行链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/serdes-high-speed-serial"},{"seq":3,"slug":"eye-diagram-equalization","title":"眼图分析与均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/high-speed-design/eye-diagram-equalization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"measurement-techniques","ti